  {
   "id": "to-the-moon-5025@major-2025-07-04",
   "gameId": "to-the-moon-5025",
   "displayName": "To the Moon series finale: Last Hour RPG update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-07-04T21:53:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/eb040a29e270669ca8f9ae74f936806a2f98b723.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hey folks, just a quick update that the making of the Last Hour RPG is still well underway. c:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've got substantial amount of assets and story planning done, but since it's our first time updating production engine ourselves, it's been taking a while to set up a solid foundation to build future games with.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/3f54789a164f342b2536f82b7b1573ab95faee97.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/e6fd600accd6c9f1a1e477e8b7a40b76fe6eaa5f.png\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/feaa068eb4b3a35568a7a57667586819c865531a.png\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/01ba5d2e2070f46687cf7aac07b14ec96948129e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/10b8af2afbc8d97ca996c75a2ae130476b7ad9d4.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It should complement the To the Moon beach episode to give a more filling ending for the series.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/3956558/532e7095cb1b9abfb500a064a013e9f7b0dbdc50.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If interested, you can +Wishlist for when it comes out or for more updates. Cheers & hope everyone's well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2664600/The_Last_Hour_of_an_Epic_TO_THE_MOON_RPG/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
