  {
   "id": "to-the-moon-5025@post-2023-03-21",
   "gameId": "to-the-moon-5025",
   "displayName": "Updating engine of default build",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-21T16:38:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Default build has been changed to run on Ancurio's MKXP engine, as is with Impostor Factory. This allows for better full screen handling (proper screen ratio), resizable window (alt-enter), a smoother experience, and rare crash bug avoidance. d-(' ' d-)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're trying it on English first, then gradually rolling them out to other languages' builds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*If there's an issue switching to proper language, you can press F7 at title screen to change language manually.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "P.S. The only drawback may be a potential issue with triggering the achievement in some cases. If that happens, one work-around for the time being is to use the -achievement legacy build to run the ending to get it. To do so, just right click To the Moon from Steam library -> Property -> BETAs -> choose -achievement build from dropdown list, close & let download. d-(' ' d-)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
